{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Truth, It Seems: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja73'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 73 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Varuṇavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Warding Tree </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>3. Saccaṅkirajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Truth, It Seems: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Saccaṁ kirevamāhaṁsu, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The truth, it seems, was spoken </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>narā ekacciyā idha; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>by certain people here—</span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Kaṭṭhaṁ niplavitaṁ seyyo, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>better a floating log </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>na tvevekacciyo naro”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>than a certain person. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Saccaṅkirajātakaṁ tatiyaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
